.","tagline":"La famiglia non è sangue, è amore"},{"language":"en-US","title":"Invisible Life","overview":"Rio de Janeiro, Brazil, 1950. In the conservative home of the Gusmão family, Eurídice and Guida are two inseparable sisters who support each other. While Guida can share with her younger sister the details of her romantic adventures, Eurídice finds in her older sister the encouragement she needs to pursue her dream of becoming a professional pianist.","tagline":"A tropical melodrama"},{"language":"pt-BR","overview":"Antigas cartas de sua irmã Guida, há muito desaparecida, surpreendem Eurídice, uma senhora de 80 anos. No Rio de Janeiro dos anos 1950, Guida e Eurídice são cruelmente separadas, impedidas de viverem os sonhos que alimentaram juntas ainda adolescentes.","tagline":"Família não é sangue, é amor."}],"images":{"logos":[],"posters":[],"backdrops":[]},"poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/yveDzw8AVqCWovtQMqJ3KhhJrK4.jpg","background":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/u2Av6NyDeLkwYTBXxIGousLNzz.jpg","seasons":[],"schema":{}}},"artworkLibrary":{"tmdb":{"schemaVersion":1,"source":"tmdb","id":548544,"type":"movie","originalLanguage":"pt-BR","series":{"poster":{"it":{"status":"available","selected":{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/yveDzw8AVqCWovtQMqJ3KhhJrK4.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/yveDzw8AVqCWovtQMqJ3KhhJrK4.jpg","language":"it","width":500,"height":750},"candidates":[{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/yveDzw8AVqCWovtQMqJ3KhhJrK4.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/yveDzw8AVqCWovtQMqJ3KhhJrK4.jpg","language":"it","width":500,"height":750},{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/zDyCnFiTQmZGjNl6fbLOMpxhs0S.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/zDyCnFiTQmZGjNl6fbLOMpxhs0S.jpg","language":"it","width":2000,"height":3000},{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/qwpjbeWflBk0cvHEOrYQRXekTaV.jpg","previewUrl":"